n he meets with garrett and tells him  what happened during the interrogation  they go to marcus to propose a new job  an ambitious one since they'll try to  steal very valuable merchandise the only  payment he wants in exchange for the job  is mia  since he wants to take her to heal his  mother  while garrett wants half of the loot  because he wants to be a partner marcus  has no choice but to accept so they  start planning the next big heist  together while mia starts to get angry  since they're only using her for the  convenience of others the plan begins  they wait for the truck that brings the  merchandise and then garrett interrupts  the truck's path while conor  electrocutes the vehicle along with two  of the four robots that were escorting  it garrett subdues the other two robots  with his powers but he can't stop them  for long so conor takes the opportunity  to disable them they try to escape but  marcus betrays them taking the  merchandise while garrett's team is  under fire  they hide and at the same time some more  drones arrive and drop two of their  robots garrett and his team escape while  the robots kill marcus men  the next day conor secretly asks to meet  with a policeman who has intentions to  solve the case conor convinces the  officer to work together with him and  catch marcus so that he can take mia to  cure his mother conor also informs him  that in the end he will turn himself  into the police voluntarily to pay for  his crimes later the police prepare to  catch marcus entering the location and  starting to kill his men  marcus tries to escape through the back  door but garrett arrives and shoots him  although one of his men covers him and  stays to fight garrett and connor work  together to finish off the man and then  they go after marcus to end his life  since he betrayed them before conor  wants to take mia to heal his mother  but she tells him that it's not that  simple showing them that by healing  people she acquires the damage in he